    <ThingDef ParentName="ArmorMachineableBase">
        <defName>BEWH_AllarusArmor</defName>
        <label>Allarus Terminator armor</label>
        <description>A suit of Terminator Power Armor, crafted from auramite for the Allarus Custodians of the Adeptus Custodes. Stronger even than their ceramite cousins, the protection provided by this armor exceeds that of some armored vehicles. 

Allarus Terminators are tasked with exterminating high-value targets in the field. Such is their relentlessness that the Allarus Terminator armor contains short-range teleporters for pursuing their foes, along with wrist-mounted Balistus grenade launchers - though this replica carries neither.</description>
