    <ThingDef ParentName="ArmorHelmetMakeableBase">
        <defName>BEWH_AllarusHelmet</defName>
        <label>Allarus Terminator helmet</label>
        <description>A strong helmet, built for the Allarus Terminators. It is highly protective due to its auramite build, well-suited for deep striking towards the enemy's leaders. 

The Custodians, unlike their Space Marine cousins, rarely remove their helmets, as they wish to remain a faceless and solid wall of auramite. Custodians of the Imperial Palace are sometimes mistaken for ornate golden statues or a mere ceremonial guard, but any threat that should foolishly present themselves will usually not live long enough to regret it.</description>
